items/thm-compact-hausdorff-space-has-a-unique-compatible-uniformity.md:4:title: "A compact Hausdorff space carries exactly one compatible uniformity"
items/thm-compact-hausdorff-space-has-a-unique-compatible-uniformity.md:24:## Statement
items/thm-compact-hausdorff-space-has-a-unique-compatible-uniformity.md:26:A compact Hausdorff topology carries exactly one compatible uniformity.
items/thm-compact-hausdorff-space-has-a-unique-compatible-uniformity.md:30:**Given:** A compact Hausdorff topology on $X$.
