          "id": "step-2.1",
          "claim": "Since $D$ is symmetric, $D[x]\\times D[x]\\subseteq D^{-1}\\circ D=D\\circ D\\subseteq E$, so $D[x]$ is $E$-small. [step 1.1, step 1.2]",
          "step": "2.1",
          "inputs": [
            "1.1",
            "1.2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "step-3.1",
