          "source_section": "Example",
          "quote": "The function $h(x)=x/(1+|x|)$ maps $\\mathbb R$ onto $(-1,1)$ with inverse $h^{-1}(t)=t/(1-|t|)$. It is uniformly continuous, but its inverse is not.",
