+        {
+          "id": "step-1.1",
+          "claim": "The maps $L_g$ and $R_g$ are continuous as composites of multiplication with constant maps, and their inverses are $L_{g^{-1}}$ and $R_{g^{-1}}$, also continuous. [L1, L2]",
