+          "quote": "A filter $\\mathcal F$ on a uniform space $(X,\\mathcal U)$ is **Cauchy** if for every entourage $E\\in\\mathcal U$ some $A\\in\\mathcal F$ satisfies $A\\times A\\subseteq E$. Such an $A$ is an $E$-small member of $\\mathcal F$.",
