+        {
+          "id": "step-1.2",
+          "claim": "Let $O$ be the union of all open subsets of $D[x]$ containing $x$. Then $O$ is open and $x\\in O\\subseteq D[x]$ because $D[x]$ is a neighbourhood. [L1, construct]",
