+          "quote": "A uniform space $X$ is **totally bounded** if, for every entourage $E$, there is a finite set $F\\subseteq X$ such that $X=\\bigcup_{x\\in F}E[x]$. Finiteness has the library meaning of [[def-finite-cardinality]].",
