+          "id": "step-2.1",
+          "claim": "For each $p\\in\\mathcal P$ and each positive radius, its ball is an original entourage by step 1.1. Hence every finite intersection defining a basic entourage of the gauge belongs to $\\mathcal U$. [step 1.1, L3]",
+          "step": "2.1",
+          "inputs": [
+            "1.1",
+            "L3"
+          ]
