+          "claim": "Let $p$ be the controlled pseudometric from [L1]. Since $\\{p\\le1/4\\}\\subseteq E_1\\subseteq U$, every $y\\in C$ satisfies $p(x,y)>1/4$. [step 1.1, L1]",
