+          "source_section": "Statement",
+          "quote": "If $\\mathcal U$ is a uniformity on $X$, then its symmetric entourages form a filter base: for every $E\\in\\mathcal U$ there is a symmetric $D\\in\\mathcal U$ with $D\\subseteq E$.",
