+          "id": "step-2.1",
+          "claim": "Compactness gives a finite subcover $V_0,\\ldots,V_{n-1}$ of $\\mathcal V$. Finite choice supplies $U_i\\in\\mathcal U$ with $\\overline{V_i}\\subseteq U_i$ for each $i<n$. [step 1.1, L2, L4]",
