+          "id": "step-1.2",
+          "claim": "Define indices recursively. Put $r_0=0$, and let $r_{n+1}$ be the least $k>r_n$ such that $B_k^{\\circ3}\\subseteq B_{r_n}$; then put $E_n=B_{r_n}$. [L1, L2, L3, construct]",
+          "step": "1.2",
