+          "quote": "- **(M1) Separation.** $d(x,y) = 0$ if and only if $x = y$.\n- **(M2) Symmetry.** $d(x,y) = d(y,x)$.\n- **(M3) Triangle inequality.** $d(x,z) \\le d(x,y) + d(y,z)$.",
+          "uses": [
