+          "source_section": "Statement",
+          "quote": "Let $\\mathcal{U}$ be an ultrafilter on a set $X$ ([[def-ultrafilter]]) and let\n$A, B \\subseteq X$. If $A \\cup B \\in \\mathcal{U}$ then $A \\in \\mathcal{U}$ or\n$B \\in \\mathcal{U}$.",
