+      "derivations": [
+        {
+          "id": "step-1.1",
+          "claim": "Since $X\\setminus C$ is an open neighbourhood of $x$, choose an entourage $E$ with $E[x]\\subseteq X\\setminus C$, then choose a symmetric $D$ with $D^{\\circ2}\\subseteq E$. [L1, L3, choose]",
