+        {
+          "id": "step-1.1",
+          "claim": "Suppose $\\mathcal U$ is separated and $x\\ne y$. Choose $E$ with $(x,y)\\notin E$, then a symmetric $D$ with $D\\circ D\\subseteq E$. [A1, L1, choose]",
