+        {
+          "id": "step-2.1",
+          "claim": "The relation $E\\mathrel R D$ meaning that $D$ is symmetric, $D\\subseteq E$, and $D\\circ D\\circ D\\subseteq E$ is serial by step 1.1. [step 1.1]",
