+          "inputs": [
+            "L2",
+            "L3"
+          ]
+        },
+        {
+          "id": "step-2.1",
+          "claim": "Thus the first two formulations are equivalent in ZF and all three are equivalent under the displayed assumption. [step 1.1, step 1.2] ∎",
