+          "id": "step-1.2",
+          "claim": "Let $\\mathcal U$ be any compatible uniformity. Each entourage-ball cover admits an open refinement because every ball is a neighbourhood in the induced topology, so every cover uniform for $\\mathcal U$ admits an open refinement. [L2, L3, L4]",
